<title>INDIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 215-7 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 215-7 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>BANGALORE, India 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 215-7 in their 50 overs against India in a day-night match in the Titan Cup triangular limited overs tournament on Monday.</p>
</text>
